\n環境：四張單人桌、兩張四人桌。內用沒有茶水提供，筷子、湯匙自取，有額外的碗提供，醬料有辣油、七味粉、辣粉。\n價格：平價，味道尚可。\n缺點：內用沒有茶水提供，可能非用餐時間，冷氣溫度稍嫌不夠涼。\n位置：位於711旁，外裝看不到內部，附近有許多機車停車位，也要收費汽車停車場。",null,[0,129]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5496351406018551903/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlBkM1ZsTFdabkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,14637,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPd3VlLWZnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x30741b1e4b431321!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICOwue-fg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPd3VlLWZnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPd3VlLWZnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ093dWUtX2dFEhNDZ3dJaklUeWxBWVF1S21Jb2dFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ093dWUtQVESE0Nnd0lqSVR5bEFZUXVLbUlvZ0UiEgkAAAAAAAAAABEhE0NLHht0MCoLMFhiNzdCSkZXSHM\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiV56aMzNKWAxWfdvUHHYnOOk4QoykI0QEoEw"],null,[null,[[1,3]]]],"0ahUKEwjro7CMzNKWAxWqeF4EHRuCIbkQ0pMFCGcoBg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiV56aMzNKWAxWfdvUHHYnOOk4Q0pMFCKsBKAY"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoeUtmYVdREAE",["0x0:0x30741b1e4b431321",null,1675470672130492,1675470672130492,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/1002495479018